flickos-screenshot (1.7) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Text from the screen (ADR-011): shot --text and the capture bar's
    Text read the area or the screen with tesseract, copy the text and
    print it. Offered only while tesseract is installed: tesseract-ocr
    is a Suggests. English first, at most three installed languages; a
    small area is read at twice its size.
  * A picture tesseract finds no text in is read again with a local
    threshold: a dark window with black around it read as nothing.

 -- Jon <dvbondoy@gmail.com>  Wed, 07 Oct 2026 11:57:21 +0800

